====================================================================================================
**B — ONE WAVE CARRIES IT.** LOWO spread **0.057** against a constant-Δ null whose 95th is **0.046**; dropping **2008** moves Δ from +0.051 to **+0.022** ⇒ **`#888`'s headline is an average over heterogeneous cells**, and the honest statement is the LOWO range **[+0.022, +0.079]**, not the pooled point.

⚠ **Registered**: four waves is four cells, so a null here is a BOUND and never a demonstration of homogeneity; the completeness rules are the ones I can defend and **unenumerated is not cleared**; and **the instrument cannot be changed** — SCCS has one observation per society and therefore no within-instrument subsample structure at all.

